WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.774
<v NARRATOR>You're standing in the team house the night before the captains' planned rookie initiation.

00:00:04.774 --> 00:00:08.393
<v NARRATOR>You already know what's coming, because it happened to you last year.

00:00:08.393 --> 00:00:14.740
<v NARRATOR>A year ago, you and your roommate Dana were the freshmen, and you were made to chug mystery mixes until someone threw up.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.622
<v NARRATOR>This year, one of the freshmen has a heart condition he never talks about.

00:00:18.622 --> 00:00:19.252
<v NARRATOR>You know it.

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:20.773
<v NARRATOR>Nobody else on the team does.
